## 1. Postman API Requests

### a. Get Shifts by Employee and Date  
GET `/shifts?employee=1&date=2025-01-15` tested; returns an empty array, showing no shifts for employee 1 on the given date.  
![Get Shifts - Postman](Screenshots/Get_Shifts.jpg)

---

### b. Create Shift - Overlapping Error  
POST `/shifts` with a conflicting time for employee 4; API correctly rejects the request with a `400 Bad Request` and error about overlapping shifts.  
![Create Shift Error](Screenshots/Create_shifts.jpg)

---

### c. Delete Shift  
DELETE `/shift/1` request successfully deletes shift 1, with a confirmation message.  
![Delete Shift](Screenshots/Delete_Shifts.jpg)

---

### d. Get All Employees - Token Error  
GET `/employees` tested; server responds with `403 Forbidden` and `"Invalid or expired token"` error, showing authentication required.  
![Get Employees Forbidden](Screenshots/Get_all_employees.jpg)

---

### e. Login Authentication  
POST `/login` successfully authenticates, returning a JWT `token` and user details.  
![Login Success](Screenshots/Login1.jpg)  
![Post Login](Screenshots/Post_Login.jpg)

